## Phase 1 Cycle Verdict

| Test | Window | Peak Period | Significant vs AR(1) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Spectral | rolling_20d | 39.5d | **NO** |
| Spectral | rolling_40d | 100.5d | **NO** |
| Spectral | rolling_60d | 118.6d | **NO** |
| Spectral | hp_filter | 8.9d | **NO** |
| Spectral | arkg_residual | 53.9d | **NO** |

**Gate decision:** proceed = True, cycle strategies = **REJECTED**, MR strategies = unlocked

**Verdict:** No spectral significance on any window against 1,000 AR(1) surrogates. The ~25-35 day cycle hypothesis is **rejected**. Mean reversion exists (Hurst < 0.5 throughout dev period), but it is not cyclical — RXRX is a trending stock with mean-reverting noise. S3 (cycle phase / Hilbert) is not justified.

